      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It resembles a round pearl as large as a goose egg. The pearl has countless markings that move around, like the blooming of a field of lotuses, or the rumbling of clouds.",
        "chapters": [
          1058
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Ordinary Gu Immortals can only use it in refinement path. Fang Yuan is a blood path grandmaster, so he can display its full ability and push it past that original limit. In the blood lake he has it draw life force, purify that force, and pour it into his body until his severed lower body is whole again.",
        "chapters": [
          1058
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After obtaining it, Fang Yuan builds blood path immortal killer moves with Blood Asset as the core, including life staking blood print, blood healing lake, and blood torrent. Blood torrent uses only this rank six Immortal Gu, so its straight line speed stays below Sword Escape Immortal Gu unless Blood Asset is raised to rank seven.",
        "chapters": [
          1061
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-killer-moves",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_sword_escape_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later uses a blood path immortal killer move with Blood Asset as the core against Hei Cheng, and he also folds the Gu into a modified familiar face so he can disguise bloodline.",
        "chapters": [
          1118
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-killer-moves",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_cheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Bloodstained conqueror’s robe is an immortal level defensive move whose core Immortal Gu is the rank six Blood Asset.",
        "chapters": [
          1126
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-killer-moves",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After injury he heals the Gu and forms a simplified blood light spirit suppression that still uses Blood Asset as the core.",
        "chapters": [
          1217
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-killer-moves",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
